      <p className="absolute left-[624.668px] top-[746.9px] whitespace-nowrap font-poppins font-normal text-[12.5px] leading-[17px] text-[#6b7280] tracking-[-0.1px]">A focused approach to senior, specialist and confidential<br />leadership searches.</p>
